. The phrases you use to talk to your friend are not as the phrases you use to talk to your boss."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Formal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Informal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Making a call</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello, this is (name) from (company).</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hey, it's (name).</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Answering the Call</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This is (name) speaking.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Somebody</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">May/Can I speak to (name), please?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Is (name) there?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reason for Calling</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm calling about/to ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Just ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Modal Can for Possibility "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The modal<span class=\"strong\"> can</span> is used to ask and say what is possible.  The negative form is<span class=\"strong\"> can't</span>. They go before a verb in the base form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I can come on Wednesday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I can't come tomorrow. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "After a question, you do not need to repeat the information in the sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Question:  Can you come on Tuesday at 2:00?<br />  Answer:   Yes, I can. - No, I can't.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to set up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make the arrangements needed for something to happen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm calling to set up an interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when setting up an interview. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "job interview "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a meeting where you answer questions to see if you are the right person for a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to set up a job interview."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slot "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short period of time for a specific event "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is there a slot in the morning?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reference letter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a letter with information about you that someone else writes  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bring your reference letter.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "qualifications "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the skills you need to do a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your qualifications match what we are looking for."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "experience "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the skills you have from past jobs "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your work experience matches what we are looking for."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le08ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (6-8 lines) about a business call."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pretend you are getting a call from someone to set up a job interview."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the modal <span class=\"italic\">can</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I start a formal telephone call."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I set up a job interview. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice talking on the telephone."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn2le08ob01re2im